{"unit_id":"buguoshixc__dsh-user-message-navigator#feature-1","repo":"buguoshixc/dsh-user-message-navigator","commit":"33ee5fbb8e252aa2dc08b88ee5d3e52daa2ba2aa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH User Message Navigator 的功能「搜索会话消息」：侧栏列出当前已加载的用户和 steering 消息。输入关键词后，列表按大小写不敏感方式过滤；选择结果会切回 Chat、滚动到原消息并短暂高亮。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/messages.ts:56-95","src/client/components.tsx:143-199","src/client/navigation.ts:20-47"]}
{"unit_id":"buguoshixc__dsh-user-message-navigator#feature-2","repo":"buguoshixc/dsh-user-message-navigator","commit":"33ee5fbb8e252aa2dc08b88ee5d3e52daa2ba2aa","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"DSH User Message Navigator 的功能「加载更早历史」：侧栏提供逐页加载和加载全部操作。逐页操作请求会话加载一页；加载全部会在仍有历史时继续请求，最多 100 页，并在完成、达到上限或失败时显示状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:27-45","src/client/components.tsx:107-129","src/client/locales.ts:16-22"]}
